ge_cta__tFt0N" aria-labelledby="hydrogen-cta-title"><div class="container page_ctaInner__5e26D"><div class="Reveal_root__6Nl5D Reveal_directionUp__lQZck"><h2 id="hydrogen-cta-title">水素商用車の導入条件を、<br/>一緒に整理しませんか。</h2><p>車両更新、走行距離、拠点、補助金、充填インフラの前提をまとめ、現実的な導入モデルを検討します。</p><div class="page_ctaActions__xjQk7"><a class="Button_button__f_l0m Button_white__ysOC9" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>contact/">お問い合わせ<span aria-hidden="true" class="Button_arrow__cvrDP">→</span></a><a class="Button_button__f_l0m Button_cyan__ZywQz page_ctaOutline__qpQQ0" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>business/">事業一覧へ戻る<span aria-hidden="true" class="Button_arrow__cvrDP">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="Footer_footer__rZB2Q" id="company"><div class="container"><div class="Footer_grid__G4Mer"><a class="Footer_logo__Rbx6w" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>"><img src="<?php echo NOAH_ASSETS; ?>/noah_logo.png" alt="諾亜建設株式会社"/></a><div class="Footer_links__6wOW9"><div class="Footer_linkGroup__TGFkU"><h3><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/">企業情報</a></h3><a class="Footer_link__16ENv" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/message/">トップメッセージ</a><a class="Footer_link__16ENv" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/vision/">企業理念・ビジョン</a><a class="Footer_link__16ENv" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/standard/">行動基準</a><a class="Footer_link__16ENv" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/outline/">会社概要</a><a class="Footer_link__16ENv" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/organization/">グループ・組織図</a><a class="Footer_link__16ENv" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/history/">沿革</a><a class="Footer_link__16ENv" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/safety-health/">健康経営</a></div><div class="Footer_linkGroup__TGFkU"><h3><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>business/">事業紹介</a></h3><a class